  "worked_solution": "Let's write the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=\u27e83-5t,2-6t,7\u27e9.\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=\u27e83-5t,2-6t,7\u27e9$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot \u27e8-6,5,4\u27e9 & =-24 \\\\ \u27e83-5t,2-6t,7\u27e9\\cdot \u27e8-6,5,4\u27e9 & =-24 \\\\ -6(3-5t)+5(2-6t)+4\\cdot 7 & =-24 \\\\ -18+30t+10-30t+28 & =-24 \\\\ 20 & =-24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation has no solution. Therefore, we conclude that the line $l$ and the plane $\u03a0$ do not intersect.",
